From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:38:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 55/79] flashnext_mia: her bursts and shared budgets on by
 default, with host tests on her lanes

Her facts turn on burst_split with burst_short 4096 (her store at db281878 kept and resumed
nothing for shorter prompts, so her host burst them all) and pooled_budgets (her round loop's
Rule.budgets). Every other family keeps the defaults.

The toy engine gains prefillMany / manyFit as cuda_engine has them, so her prefill_many runs
under the lane host. New tests (test-flashnext-mia-host):
- sixteen queued prompts, each resuming a 3-token kept state, prefill in one burst on her
  Lanes(Toy) under the real LaneHost and prompt-cache store, replies equal to the target's;
- four live streams' budgets from her facts' Rule are db281878's (3 each), not f212's (2).
Both fail with the two opt-ins off (0 bursts; 2 each).

Port: her lane scheduling rules (0007 admitAll, db281878 budgets) as her family's defaults (MiaAI-Lab)
